OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells through
OL,7,Fthe day, best of the sunshine in the
OL,8,Feast. There will be a scattering of
OL,9,Flight showers across the north and
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain will spread
OL,13,Finto the west this evening, mainly dry
OL,14,Facross the east. The rest of the night
OL,15,Fwill be cloudy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,16,Fmainly in west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
