OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FMostly cloudy with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain, but drier and occasionally
OL,7,Fbrighter around Inverness and Nairn.
OL,8,FFresh southwesterly winds,
OL,9,Foccasionally strong in the northwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fand breezy on Saturday with spells of
OL,13,Frain, this most persistent in the west
OL,14,Fbut drier spells in the east. Early
OL,15,Frain on Sunday then dry. Dry Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
